  "rule": "The VLA is asked continuously (pipelined); each answer it parsed sets the intent, held until the next and expiring expiry_s after it arrived. Fresh step + the controller's lock: controller_follow (the controller flies with its stand-off at the VLA's desired range, far m at fwd 0 to near m at fwd 5, moved at most s_rate_mps). Fresh step, no lock: vla_search (vla_fly's follow tracker flies the step). Fresh LAND: hold (the controller at the stand-off in force with the lock, the tracker's arrival hold without). Otherwise controller_fallback (the controller's own behaviour, its stand-off reached at the same rate). After the controller's slew limiter, before the Shield, which filters every command"
